      "html": "<p>A weekly selection of useful agent skills, updates, and practical workflows, delivered every Wednesday.</p><h2><strong>Skill of the Week</strong></h2><p><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/beltsh/superpowers/blob/93a647364937903fa2f45629ca7c5f9c89fc57c9/guides/design/youtube-thumbnail-design/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube Thumbnail Design</a></strong> &#8212; A busy YouTube thumbnail can become a blur in the mobile feed. This guide shows how to build around one focal point and preview the design at 120 pixels wide to check that viewers can recognize the subject and read any text.</p><h2><strong>Agents &amp; Automation</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/google/skills/blob/3954bb229b6d4ca4051c3ebd161174c1e509e2d9/skills/cloud/cloud-operator-share-context/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Share approved Google Cloud context with the operator agent memory</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/nousresearch/hermes-agent/blob/4c84e78629cf1cdfcb79bea3b39aa4a49003c829/optional-skills/autonomous-ai-agents/agent-merge-conflict-arbiter/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Neutral third-party arbitration of git merge conflicts between two agents</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/trailofbits/skills/blob/149d7b21f4067765b82e67029730b42d228ef4b4/plugins/code-improver/skills/skill-improver/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Run autonomous skill review-and-fix loop to clean review</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain-skills/blob/ab84b0b5a3164ee17eb78b0828e58c48186f54ce/skills/langchain-managed-deep-agents/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build and deploy Managed Deep Agents with the mda CLI</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/blob/5cec6716767283f4675a05f5f8855b5b49c81783/plugins/plugin-dev/skills/agent-development/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Authoring Claude Code plugin agents with frontmatter and system prompts</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/obra/superpowers/blob/22f0b463e7a5e579904dd6211a520321035526f7/skills/diagnosing-superpowers/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Diagnose what went wrong in a Superpowers agent session with evidence</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/google/skills/blob/3954bb229b6d4ca4051c3ebd161174c1e509e2d9/skills/cloud/cloud-operator-setup/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Set up a personal Google Cloud operator agent step by step</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/blob/5cec6716767283f4675a05f5f8855b5b49c81783/plugins/claude-code-setup/skills/claude-automation-recommender/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Analyze a codebase and recommend Claude Code automations</a></p></li></ul><h2><strong>Development &amp; Engineering</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/expo/skills/blob/e577fe1524106faa3b241430874cb3c495e6b9db/plugins/expo/skills/expo-dev-client/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build and distribute Expo development clients for internal testing</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/google/skills/blob/3954bb229b6d4ca4051c3ebd161174c1e509e2d9/skills/ads/data-manager-api-setup/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Setting up Data Manager API authentication and libraries</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/blob/7297e6bd9fd3baf96e5f0624086e3278b7cfed5f/skills/acreadiness-policy/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Author and apply AgentRC readiness scoring policies</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser/blob/0a923358ea989d7602f0d06507ad3447c62ffe9b/skill-data/vercel/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Access protecte