powers/blob/22f0b463e7a5e579904dd6211a520321035526f7/skills/verification-before-completion/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Require fresh verification evidence before claiming work complete</a></p></li></ul><h2><strong>Data &amp; Research</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/google/skills/blob/3954bb229b6d4ca4051c3ebd161174c1e509e2d9/skills/ads/data-manager-api-troubleshooting/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Diagnose Data Manager API ingestion errors, warnings, and missing records</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins/blob/5e504ae11498f2b8daa30d86b7dab97b2ecd8092/data/skills/data-context-extractor/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build company data analysis skill from analyst tribal knowledge</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw/blob/300df005c24cba5c49dd1ec6f4037ab6a968bd52/.github/skills/retrieve-public-aw-workflows/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Retrieve public gh-aw workflows as verified immutable snapshots</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins/blob/5e504ae11498f2b8daa30d86b7dab97b2ecd8092/data/skills/write-query/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Write optimized SQL for a chosen dialect from natural language</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/blob/49f948faa9258a0c61caceaf225e179651397431/skills/.curated/notion-research-documentation/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Research Notion pages and produce cited briefs or reports</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins/blob/5e504ae11498f2b8daa30d86b7dab97b2ecd8092/data/skills/analyze/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Answer data questions from quick lookups to formal reports</a></p></li></ul><h2><strong>Writing &amp; Productivity</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=