      "html": "<p>A weekly selection of useful agent skills, updates, and practical workflows, delivered every Wednesday.</p><h2><strong>Skill of the Week</strong></h2><p><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/blob/cda84222aa12716f2ceb92b45629487be81a0601/.agents/skills/changelog-video/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">changelog-video</a></strong> &#8212; Turning weekly release notes into a video means juggling visuals, narration, and captions. This internal HyperFrames workflow builds a branded video project from Markdown with animated UI mockups, using repository assets, companion skills, and an authenticated HeyGen CLI.</p><h2><strong>This Week&#8217;s Picks</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/skills/blob/2c5958ecac7cee2b583967a2c4981d0f4a75c579/skills/xlsx/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Data] Create and edit spreadsheets with openpyxl, pandas, and formulas</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/supabase/agent-skills/blob/c9be0e931b7930f7d02126d04774d904c381e7d7/skills/supabase-postgres-best-practices/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Data] Prioritized Postgres rules for schema, queries, and RLS</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills/blob/9d6d7ce8d18eb155dc2f9762435f097e60cdad7c/skills/attribution/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Marketing] Diagnose which marketing channels actually drive revenue</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser/blob/f423bb090ccdcadd0de587dd77eed3430d93a306/skill-data/derive-client/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Agent workflows] Deriving Standalone API Clients From HAR Recordings</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/obra/superpowers/blob/22f0b463e7a5e579904dd6211a520321035526f7/skills/subagent-driven-development/SKILL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[Agent w